---
title: Tempo Adjust
description: Tempo Adjust is a set of browser extensions that let DJs detect and adjust the tempo of tracks on Bandcamp and Discogs.
---

{% import 'components.njk' as components %}

<section class="header">
  <div class="header__logo-container">
    <img
      src="{{ image }}"
      alt="{{ title }}"
      class="header__logo--h1 og-image"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="header__text">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="header__subtitle">For Bandcamp and Discogs</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <picture>
    <source
      srcset="/images/tempo-adjust-hero-dark.png"
      media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"
    />
    <img
      eleventy:ignore
      src="/images/tempo-adjust-hero-light.png"
      alt="The same Bandcamp album open in Safari on a Mac, an iPad, and an iPhone, each with Tempo Adjust's pitch fader under the player"
      class="lineup"
      width="650"
      height="380"
    />
  </picture>
  <p>
    {{ description }} On Chrome and Firefox it ships as two extensions,
    Bandcamp Tempo Adjust and Discogs Tempo Adjust.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="install" class="install">
  <h2>Install it in your browser</h2>
  <ul class="browser-tiles">
    <li class="browser-tile">
      <img src="/images/safari-icon.png" alt="" class="browser-tile__icon" />
      <p class="browser-tile__name">Safari</p>
      <p class="browser-tile__platforms">Mac, iPhone, and iPad</p>
      <div class="browser-tile__actions">
        <a
          href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tempo-adjust/id6746218641"
          class="app-store-badge"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <picture>
            <source
              srcset="/images/app-store-badge-white.svg"
              media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"
            />
            <img
              eleventy:ignore
              src="/images/app-store-badge-black.svg"
              alt="Download on the App Store"
              width="150"
              height="50"
            />
          </picture>
        </a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="browser-tile">
      <img src="/images/chrome-icon.png" alt="" class="browser-tile__icon" />
      <p class="browser-tile__name">Chrome</p>
      <p class="browser-tile__platforms">Desktop</p>
      <div class="browser-tile__actions">
        {{
          components.linkButton("Bandcamp",
          "https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/bandcamp-tempo-adjust/iniomjoihcjgakkfaebmcbnhmiobppel",
          "/images/bandcamp-tempo-adjust-logo.png")
        }}
        {{
          components.linkButton("Discogs",
          "https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/discogs-tempo-adjust/lifpcepdalajjkklljnfcjpjjjllfhha",
          "/images/discogs-tempo-adjust-logo.png", "invert-on-dark")
        }}
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="browser-tile">
      <img src="/images/firefox-icon.png" alt="" class="browser-tile__icon" />
      <p class="browser-tile__name">Firefox</p>
      <p class="browser-tile__platforms">Desktop and Android</p>
      <div class="browser-tile__actions">
        {{
          components.linkButton("Bandcamp",
          "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/bandcamp-tempo-adjust/",
          "/images/bandcamp-tempo-adjust-logo.png")
        }}
        {{
          components.linkButton("Discogs",
          "https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/discogs-tempo-adjust/",
          "/images/discogs-tempo-adjust-logo.png", "invert-on-dark")
        }}
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="resources">
    {{
      components.linkButton("Get help",
      "/tempo-adjust/support/",
      "/images/support-icon.png", "invert-on-dark", newTab=false)
    }}
    {{
      components.linkButton("GitHub",
      "https://github.com/azarbayejani/bandcamp-tempo-adjust",
      "/images/github-icon.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
    {{
      components.linkButton("Donate",
      "https://buymeacoffee.com/miseryconfusion",
      "/images/donate-icon.png", "invert-on-dark")
    }}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Tempo adjustment:</strong> a pitch fader for every player, on
      album, track, and collection pages on Bandcamp and on release videos on
      Discogs
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Master tempo:</strong> change the tempo without changing the pitch
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>BPM detection:</strong> detect the BPM of any track (Bandcamp
      only)
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Purchase export:</strong> export your Bandcamp purchases with
      currency conversion to analyze your spending
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <p><em>On Discogs:</em></p>
  <picture>
    <source
      srcset="/images/tempo-adjust-discogs-dark.png"
      media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"
    />
    <img
      eleventy:ignore
      src="/images/tempo-adjust-discogs-light.png"
      alt="The same Discogs release open in Safari on a Mac, an iPad, and an iPhone, each with Tempo Adjust's pitch fader under the release video"
      class="lineup"
      width="650"
      height="380"
    />
  </picture>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Press</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://ra.co/news/81694"
        >New free web extension allows Discogs users to adjust tempos</a
      >, Resident Advisor, November 2024
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://cdm.link/bandcamp-and-discogs-tempo-adjust/"
        >Bandcamp and Discogs Tempo Adjust has a new UI</a
      >, CDM, November 2024
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <p>
    <small
      >Tempo Adjust does not collect any data. Read the
      <a href="/tempo-adjust/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</small
    >
  </p>
</section>
